#===============================================================================
# Profane Apothecary Pathfinder - item filter  v1.0
# For Path of Exile 3.30 (Covens of Umbra). Written for one character: Poisonous Concoction
# through the campaign, then Marohi Erqi slams (see the build guide).
#
# INSTALL
#   1) Put this file in:  %USERPROFILE%\Documents\My Games\Path of Exile
#   2) In game: Escape -> Options -> Game -> Filters, pick "profane-apothecary".
#   3) After editing the file, press the reload button next to that list.
#
# IF THE GAME REFUSES TO LOAD IT
#   The message names a line number. Every block below stands alone, so delete
#   the block that line belongs to (from its Show/Hide line to the next blank
#   line), save and reload.
#
# HOW IT IS BUILT
#   The first block that matches an item decides how it looks. Nothing at the
#   end hides "everything else": an item no block matches is shown the way the
#   game shows it without a filter. Only these are ever hidden:
#     - outgrown life and mana flasks, and flasks or tinctures the build has no slot for
#     - normal and magic weapons, quivers, armour and shields from area level 14
#     - normal and magic rings, amulets and belts in maps
#     - rare weapons, quivers, shields and off-build armour from tier 11 maps
#   Uniques, currency, maps, fragments, cards, gems and jewels are never hidden.
#   Hold the highlight key (Alt) with Always Highlight on to see hidden items.
#
# PINK means "for this build". The guide's Loot filter section lists every colour.
# Generated 2026-11-14 by mkfilter.py. Not affiliated with Grinding Gear Games.
#===============================================================================

#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THINGS THAT ARE SHOWN EVERYWHERE
# These come first, so no later rule can hide them.
#-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Show # sixlink: Any six-linked item
	LinkedSockets 6
	SetFontSize 45
	SetTextColor 255 255 255
	SetBorderColor 255 255 255
	SetBackgroundColor 190 20 30 255
	PlayAlertSound 6 300
	MinimapIcon 0 Red Star
	PlayEffect Red

Show # build_unique: A unique on one of the four bases the build wears: Karui Maul, Stibnite Flask, Carnal Mitts, Triumphant Lamellar
	Rarity Unique
	BaseType == "Karui Maul" "Stibnite Flask" "Carnal Mitts" "Triumphant Lamellar"
	SetFontSize 45
	SetTextColor 255 255 255
	SetBorderColor 255 90 200
	SetBackgroundColor 150 20 110 255
	PlayAlertSound 1 300
	MinimapIcon 0 Pink Star
	PlayEffect Pink

Show # unique: Every other unique
	Rarity Unique
	SetFontSize 40
	SetTextColor 175 96 37
	SetBorderColor 175 96 37
	SetBackgroundColor 25 14 5 245
	PlayAlertSound 3 200
	MinimapIcon 1 Brown Star
	PlayEffect Brown Temp

Show # fated: Items carrying the Fated flag
	Fated True
	SetFontSize 38
	SetTextColor 255 255 255
	SetBorderColor 200 200 200
	SetBackgroundColor 60 60 60 245
	MinimapIcon 2 Grey Diamond

